0 39 538 [
[(A [send~] object copies its input to a local buffer which all [receive~])]
[(objects of the same name read from. They may be in different windows or)]
[(even different patches. Any number of [receive~] may be associated with)]
[(one [send~], but it is an error to have two [send~] objects of the same)]
[(name. A [receive~] takes "set" messages with address names to switch)]
[(between different [send~] objects \050just 'set' unsets the object\051. Multi)]
[(channel connections is supported.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
